{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative turn-based third-person tactics for two players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coterists or Kotnaz? Which side will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wound lickers, bomber cats, dark ones, komikotzes, and others are ready for you to take control of them and lead them to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think through your tactics against your opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control up to 5 cats in a squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend on one device or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show who is the best tactician and become a real cat!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930230?t=1768807521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/10dce1a47edfa2308ad7eb2ef8534a8309bc1c9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768807521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/1aef36c3950e8738566a06a9cbd911996f6de2ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768807521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930230/1aef36c3950e8738566a06a9cbd911996f6de2ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768807521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains scenes of violence, so may not be suitable for all audiences. The game features scenes of battles between combat cat units: shoo